      "writtenOn": "2024-05-22T18:16:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Looking at the gold changes it looks like `mandoline` on CPU is pointing out the issue you\u0027re planning to fix in the non-deferred mode? Do we want that side of the fix to land first?",
      "revId": "56273437ea66d1e8bd7d8f9fcf3d70620fb98191",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "6a233cf0_7f451f32",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
